This version is the one Joan performed live on her "From Every Stage" album.  Like many of Dylan's songs covered by others the covers rarely match Dylan's voicing and cadence.  There’s a whole litany of theories concerning this ballad.  Does Jack die, did Lily save him, are Rosemary and Lily the same person?  Google the song title sometime.  Whatever theory you like best is the right one.

TIP:  If transposing, play the root chord of the transposed (CaddG) and (Gadd) and add the 5th note as necessary.

   
